"primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171641761", "author": {"steamid": "76561198753101850", "personaname": "NuaYan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198753101850/", "num_games_owned": 212, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 1214, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 226, "last_played": 1777658024, "avatar": "f2d2716d9ecc28eaf1606f08e924e6197a9f34e1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game for porn addicts but be honest good game good combat fun story audio quality 10/10 graphics 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1723064895, "timestamp_updated": 1723064895, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171641370", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005439390", "personaname": "Teatime", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/chudmaxingtothemax/", "num_games_owned": 1408, "num_reviews": 2206, "playtime_forever": 5662, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5662, "last_played": 1725312121, "avatar": "238e82f6fe31e670c7530b1866af1dbcfd470d6a"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the best free-to-play game I have ever played. & I've played a lot of them. I normally hate them, & I disagree with the business model on principle. I also dislike Nexon because they are known for shutting down their servers, robbing their paying customers of the product they supported. But this game is good. Imagine borderlands, but better, & also free, & also not gay. This is the first free-to-play game I have gotten into in a big way, & also the first MMO style game I have gotten into in a big way.\n\nGood:\n - Waifus.\n\nBad:\n - Free-to-play is cancer.\n - No option to turn off subtitles.\n - Nexon has a history of shutting down games & giving no refunds.\n - I don't like the way the game forces you to use certain characters to farm certain items, or penalises you for not using certain characters to farm certain items.\n\nAnnoying:\n - You can't easily tell the difference between running & walking. Basically there are just 2 run animations, a fast one & a slightly faster one. This is annoying, especially when you are playing as Bunny, & your movement speed has a huge effect on your damage output. It's also a missed opportunity to add a sexy walk animation like the one in Nier Automata.", "timestamp_created": 1723064459, "timestamp_updated": 1725312319, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171640774", "author": {"steamid": "76561198879376092", "personaname": "Kenshi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kenshistarship/", "num_games_owned": 190, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 385, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 385, "last_played": 1723033104, "avatar": "4dd8f5d46fe2d14cdfaa821b9e1999acd800db60"}, "language": "english", "review": "its like if they took the good parts of Warframe and Destiny 2 and threw it out the window.", "timestamp_created": 1723063745, "timestamp_updated": 1723063745, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "17